    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 51]\ntheorem erdos_352 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∃ c > (0: ℝ), ∀ A : Set ℝ², MeasurableSet A → ℙ A ≥ c.toEReal\n       → (∃ t : Affine.Triangle ℝ ℝ²,\n           (∀ p : Fin 3, t.points p ∈ A) ∧\n           EuclideanGeometry.triangle_area (t.points 0) (t.points 1) (t.points 2) = 1)",
